# Logs
# 只忽略根目录的日志目录：裸 `logs` 会连 `src/**/logs/` 这样的源码目录一起忽略，
# 曾导致新增组件被静默排除在提交之外（CI 全量类型检查才发现）。
/logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
.pnpm-store/
dist
dist-ssr
coverage/
*.local

# Environment variables
.env                    # Local personal config (not committed)
*.local                 # All *.local files (personal overrides)
!.env.example           # Template file (committed)
!.env.development       # Development environment (committed, optional)
!.env.staging           # Staging environment (committed)
!.env.production        # Production environment (committed)

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

